Men's Cycle helps you log condition and habits, and review abstinence (charge) progress on a calendar and charts.

[Read the development story on note](https://note.com/nice_acacia5247/n/na92c0bd4656b)

What you can do
• Quick logging and calendar view
• Charge streak / trends and partner insights
• Optional passcode lock on launch
• Guest mode (this device) or sign-in for cloud sync

Works without an account. Sign in with Google or email to keep data across devices.
